@tesla now offers FSD via subscription in Europe..
The Netherlands is the first European country where legal approval has been granted for FSD (Supervised).

The rollout of FSD (Supervised) begins in the coming days via wireless software updates. Additionally, Tesla is introducing a new subscription for Full Self-Driving in the Netherlands today: for €99 per month instead of a one-time purchase. Both options will remain available for a few more weeks, after which only the subscription will remain.
